/**
 * @addtogroup Foundation_BuildGuide_Windows
 * @ingroup Foundation_BuildGuide
 *
 * @section FoundationBuildWindowsToolchains Supported Windows Toolchains
 *
 * Windows precompiled libraries must be separated by toolchain.
 *
 * Recommended presets:
 *
 * @code
 * windows_msvc_x64_debug
 * windows_msvc_x64_release
 * windows_msvc_x64_coverage
 * @endcode
 *
 * Optional future presets:
 *
 * @code
 * windows_mingw_x64_debug
 * windows_mingw_x64_release
 * windows_clang_x64_debug
 * windows_clang_x64_release
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section FoundationBuildWindowsMSVC MSVC
 *
 * MSVC uses a multi-configuration generator.
 *
 * CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE is ignored by Visual Studio generators.
 * Always pass the configuration during build and install.
 *
 * @code{bash}
 * cmake --preset windows_msvc_x64_release
 * cmake --build --preset windows_msvc_x64_release --config Release
 * cmake --install build/windows_msvc_x64_release --config Release --prefix dist/windows_msvc_x64_release
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section FoundationBuildWindowsExport Export
 *
 * Recommended:
 *
 * @code{bash}
 * ./scripts/export.ps1 windows_msvc_x64_release Release
 * @endcode
 */
